{
  "title": "When Colors Fade",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mbox stub\" style=\"border-left-width:8px;margin-bottom:5px;border-left-color:#d6d6d6;position:relative;display:flex;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid #d6d6d6;min-height:32px\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\" style=\"display:table;padding:8px 15px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;image mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-right:15px;display:table-cell;height:100%;vertical-align:middle;width:40px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest?cb=20240703174053\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20240703174053\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08.png\" data-image-key=\"Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\" style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\" style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">This <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_Stubs\" title=\"Category:Article Stubs\">page</a> is in need of information.</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"display:block\">Can you help out? <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/When_Colors_Fade?action=edit\">Click here to add more.</a><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text&#95;&#95;comment\" style=\"font-size:small\">Requirements + languages + dialogue</div></div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-mbox\" title=\"Dismiss\" style=\"color:#bbb;right:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;top:0;transition:all .15s ease-in;position:absolute;padding:2px 7px;font-weight:bold\"></span></div></div></div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">When Colors Fade</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tutorial_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tutorial Quests\">Tutorial</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"requirement\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Requirements</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Complete any Overflowing Palette challenge.</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Description</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">A vibrant painting in the wild, a landscape drained of its colors, and a mysterious, suspicious communication...<br />What is the true intent behind the caller? Head to Egla Town and speak with her to uncover the truth.</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRewards\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rewards\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"card-list-container\"><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-4\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advanced_Resonance_Potion\" title=\"Advanced Resonance Potion\"><img alt=\"Advanced Resonance Potion\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Advanced Resonance Potion.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Advanced_Resonance_Potion.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e2/Item_Advanced_Resonance_Potion.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240524152949\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 2</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-4\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advanced_Energy_Core\" title=\"Advanced Energy Core\"><img alt=\"Advanced Energy Core\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Advanced Energy Core.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Advanced_Energy_Core.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/b/b5/Item_Advanced_Energy_Core.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240524153038\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 2</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-4\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advanced_Sealed_Tube\" title=\"Advanced Sealed Tube\"><img alt=\"Advanced Sealed Tube\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Advanced Sealed Tube.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Advanced_Sealed_Tube.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d6/Item_Advanced_Sealed_Tube.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240529094344\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 1</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\"><img alt=\"Shell Credit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Shell Credit.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Shell_Credit.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d1/Item_Shell_Credit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523132525\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 10,000</span></span></div></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abby\" title=\"Abby\">Abby</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\">Rover</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Vida\" title=\"Vida\">Vida</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>When Colors Fade</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Tutorial_Quest\" title=\"Tutorial Quest\">Tutorial Quest</a> that occurs in <a href=\"/wiki/Rinascita\" title=\"Rinascita\">Rinascita</a>, [[<span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Nation (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6TmF0aW9uP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Template:Nation</span>]].\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Find Merchant Vida in Egla Town</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_notes\">Gameplay notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Completing this quest unlocks <a href=\"/wiki/Vida\" title=\"Vida\">Stillwind Sundries</a> shop.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dd><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-title\"><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"UI Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0f/UI_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260501180345\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"UI Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"UI_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Quest Description</b></div><hr class=\"description-separator\" /><div class=\"description-content\">A vibrant painting in the wild, a landscape drained of its colors, and a mysterious, suspicious communication...<br />What is the true intent behind the caller? Head to Egla Town and speak with her to uncover the truth.</div></div></dd>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Upon completing the first Overflowing Palette challenge)</dt>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> (A call from an unknown contact... What could it be?)</dd>\n<dd><b>???:</b> Hey, is it Rover? I hope I've finally reached the right person...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Yes, speaking. And you are?\n<dl><dd><b>???:</b> Hello, I'm Vida, running a modest business in Egla Town.</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> I'm not interested in your product, thank you.\n<dl><dd><b>???:</b> Oh, don't worry. I don't do cold calls. I run a small business here in Egla Town. Just call me Vida.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> I've seen you before, haven't I?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> What can I do for you?</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><b>Vida:</b> Have you come across these paintings of vibrant colors standing in a dreary field in the wild?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> As if the world around it has lost its color?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> As if the world around it has lost its vitality?</dd>\n<dd><b>Vida:</b> Sure, it seems you've encountered them already. The Pioneer Association refers to those Tacet Discords as \"Overflowing Palettes\", and the areas they affect are known as \"Faded Zones\".</dd>\n<dd><b>Vida:</b> Such strange phenomena have quietly spread throughout Rinascita, leaving ordinary people completely helpless...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> I've just restored a spot.</dd>\n<dd><b>Vida:</b> Wait... you did? I knew you were the right person to talk to.</dd>\n<dd><b>Vida:</b> Please find me in Egla Town when you have a moment. I have a favor to ask of you and we can discuss the details when we meet.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> (The call has ended.)</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> Yawn - Just woke up and already hear you guys chatting...</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> Wait a minute, this person seems suspicious. How does she know your contact details?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> We'll find out.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> For I'm the famous Rover!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Talk to Vida in Egla Town)</dt>\n<dd><b>Vida:</b> You're here at last! I was just wondering how much longer I'd have to wait.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Why did you suddenly reach out to me?</dd>\n<dd><b>Vida:</b> Because... 'Here's to a world of discoveries and wonders.'</dd>\n<dd><b>Vida:</b> Hmm, sounds familiar. Isn't that the slogan of the <a href=\"/wiki/Pioneer_Association\" title=\"Pioneer Association\">Pioneer Association</a>?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Are you with the Pioneer Association?</dd>\n<dd><b>Vida:</b> I used to be. Back when I was a traveling merchant, I also worked briefly as a contract photographer for the Pioneer Association, capturing landscapes along the trade routes to earn some travel expenses.</dd>\n<dd><b>Vida:</b> Now... as you can see, those strange phenomena have drained the color from many places, making it harder to capture great photos. I've settled down and opened my own shop, so I haven't renewed my contract.</dd>\n<dd><b>Vida:</b> But deep down, I am still unable to move past the faded landscapes.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Do you want me to restore those areas?</dd>\n<dd><b>Vida:</b> Always feels like a breeze to chat with a sharp mind like yours. That is exactly why I got your contact from a former colleague. After all, no one wants the places in their memories to be covered in dull patches, right?</dd>\n<dd><b>Vida:</b> If wa can only see those familiar landscapes in photos from now on... its a depressing thought, isn't it?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Let's talk terms first.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> How about a little something to sweeten the deal?</dd>\n<dd><b>Vida:</b> Certainly, I wouldn't expect you to help for free. The Faded Zones often hold abudant mineral deposits and resources. But they can't be accessed due to the influence of the Overflowing Palettes.</dd>\n<dd><b>Vida:</b> Restoring the zones will not only bring back the colors but also the resources. You can trade them with me for some... rare items on the market.</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> Sounds like this is her true intention...</dd>\n<dd><b>Vida:</b> As a merchant, it's my fundamental skill. So, what do you think? Those goods and offers are exclusively for partners.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Understood, let's seal the deal.</dd>\n<dd><b>Vida:</b> Alright, take a look at what's on the shelves. The resources are just what you need right now.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><b>Vida:</b> Thank you for your patronage. From now on, we're long-term business partners.</dd>\n<dd><b>Vida:</b> Let's work together to reclaim the natural colors of our world!</dd>\n<dt>(Quest Complete)</dt></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_EN_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221541\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;English</b></td><td>When Colors Fade</td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHS Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHS Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5f/Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221618\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Simplified\"><small>(S)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">当色彩消逝</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHT Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHT Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHT_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/02/Emoji_ZHT_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221733\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Traditional\"><small>(T)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">當色彩消逝</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji JA Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji JA Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_JA_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/8/84/Emoji_JA_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221804\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">彩りのない世界</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji KO Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji KO Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_KO_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5d/Emoji_KO_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221837\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">색이</span> <span lang=\"ko\">바래면</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji FR Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji FR Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_FR_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/c/c6/Emoji_FR_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221935\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#